    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Doctor, if we just rush into the broadcast tower, I'm sure we'll run straight into Cronin's ambush."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "If we move together, Schwarz will definitely try to disarm your forces first, and I won't be able to contain her at all."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Even if we seize the broadcast tower by force, without the support of the government, my words will only confuse the public and cause panic."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "If Schwarz is protecting Cronin, that will prove to be a major obstacle for you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Most importantly, you'll have to figure out a way to find out whatever Cronin is hiding."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Maybe Cronin really is innocent, but..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_188_helage_1",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur",
        "text": "In that case, we'd just force him to announce the news?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_188_helage_1",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Right. If that's what it boils down to, I don't mind using force, since I was thinking the same thing."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_188_helage_1",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur",
        "text": "That takes some guts, Miss Ceylon. Maybe even borders on reckless."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_188_helage_1",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Rhodes Island has already proven my conclusion through their lab tests. If I don't do this, countless lives are going to be lost here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_188_helage_1",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur",
        "text": "I'm not trying to blame you, Miss. I just don't get to decide whether Rhodes Island can go along with your plan."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_188_helage_1",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Do you mean..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_188_helage_1",
            "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur",
        "text": "Doctor. You should be well aware of our options as well as their consequences. What should we do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "We've already come this far. There's only one thing to do!;......;Letting countless innocents suffer violates our credo.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_188_helage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur",
        "text": "So, who will take responsibility for this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Nobody, as long as no-one finds out.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_188_helage_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur",
        "text": "That's our Doctor."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur",
        "text": "Miss Ceylon, let's go before it's too late."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Doctor..."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Do what you have to do.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "I understand. I'll hold Schwarz back."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Besides, there's something I must do. I need to know the answer..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
