        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Schwarz..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Why are you pushing me away?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "Milady, you've received an education in Victoria. You belong somewhere better. Don't stay here and struggle with people like us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "...No. I don't agree with that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Schwarz, what do you think I see you as? And what do you think of me as?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "I am not the person you think I am, milady."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Because you've killed someone?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Because you've killed many people?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "No, milady. That's enough."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Perhaps we're both mistaken, Schwarz."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "I don't want you to know about that, milady!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Sorry."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "...Milady?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "I already know. I've already heard about your past... even if it's just a little bit of it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "I'm sorry if you didn't want me to learn about it, but I can't just feign ignorance."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "No, milady! You're not supposed to know that! You should have..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "I should have what? Kept doing what was expected of me? Kept studying hard, and then rise to the upper class? As if!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "I'm not some delicate flower, nor am I an ignorant little princess! I have something that I must do!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "All of us have a responsibility to protect Siesta. You and I, and my father as well! None of us are bystanders!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "You didn't want me to get involved in this in order to protect me, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "No, I..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "You're just like my father. Trying to dictate everything for me because it's 'for my own good,' but I don't think so!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "So what if what I'm doing is dangerous? So what if you have a dark past?! Maybe I'll cry or be terrified or even be hurt by these things..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "But if you ever say 'Ceylon, I need your help,' I'll always be there for you! No matter what you have to say, I'll always lend you my ear!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "If we really are friends, then we should do that for each other. How can we be considered friends when you're the only one doing the giving?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "So, Schwarz, would you help me right now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "You asked me before why I'm doing this. And this is my answer..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "So, would you give me your response, Schwarz? If what happened in the past is truly in the past, could you be my friend again, just like before?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "Milady... I'm sorry. I'm sorry for what I've done and said. My actions have caused a misunderstanding between us that never should have happened..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Ah..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "Milady, you are my friend. And you always have been."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_020"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin's Henchman",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin's Henchman",
        "text": "Are you two still chit-chatting? What's the verdict? What's going on over there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "Milady, please tell me, what are we going to do next?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Huh? I, um... I'd like to spread the news about the impending Catastrophe through official channels."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Rhodes Island should be collecting evidence against Cronin as we speak, and he'll soon be kicked out of the City Council..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "However, after the news gets out, the Obsidian Festival will have to be canceled, and Siesta will have to move..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "Don't worry, milady."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "R-really?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "If that's what you desire, then I will support you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Schwarz..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "Milady, do you need me to protect you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Mm, yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
